  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- **Breaking: renamed for Microsoft.VisualStudio.Threading.Analyzers' VSTHRD200,** which asks a method that returns a task to end in Async: `TypermediaTestClient.ConnectTo` is `ConnectToAsync`, `AlsoConnectTo` is `AlsoConnectToAsync`, and `TestingEndpointHost.DisposeAsyncWithoutWaitingForEndpointsToBeAtRest` is `DisposeWithoutWaitingForEndpointsToBeAtRestAsync`.\n- **Requires newer minor versions of other Compze packages:** Compze.DependencyInjection 0.10.0-alpha (was 0.9.0-alpha), Compze.Internals.SystemCE 0.10.0-internal (was 0.8.0-internal), Compze.Sql.MicrosoftSql 0.6.0-alpha (was 0.5.0-alpha), Compze.Sql.MySql 0.7.0-alpha (was 0.5.0-alpha), Compze.Sql.PostgreSql 0.6.0-alpha (was 0.5.0-alpha), Compze.Sql.Sqlite 0.6.0-alpha (was 0.5.0-alpha), Compze.Tessaging 0.11.0-alpha (was 0.9.0-alpha), Compze.Teventive.TeventStore.Abstractions 0.7.0-alpha (was 0.6.0-alpha), Compze.Teventive.TeventStore.MicrosoftSql 0.4.0-alpha (was 0.3.0-alpha), Compze.Teventive.TeventStore.MySql 0.4.0-alpha (was 0.3.0-alpha), Compze.Teventive.TeventStore.PostgreSql 0.4.1-alpha (was 0.3.0-alpha), Compze.Teventive.TeventStore.Sqlite 0.4.0-alpha (was 0.3.0-alpha), Compze.Threading 0.13.0-alpha (was 0.12.0-alpha). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here too, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
